  "summary": "Provides the ToDictionary() extension method for JObjects which converts a JObject\n    recursively to a Dictionary of Dictionaries. Keys are strings, values are boxed as\n    object but have \"proper\" underlying types. Works on collections within the JSON blob\n    too.",
